    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Representatives of The Federation of the Royal Colleges of Physicians of the UK (RCP) visited AKU to explore opportunities for certifying the institution to conduct PACES exam for MRCP. The Membership of the Royal Colleges of Physicians of the United Kingdom (MRCP-UK) diploma is an essential requirement for physicians who train in a medical specialty in the UK. It is an examination that the three royal colleges of physicians of the UK have in common regarding general medicine.",
